          "v": "."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "所有飞往西班牙的乘客被要求继续等候，何时出发另行通知。（浦东）"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "And you didn’t "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "notice"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " anything unusual?"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "你没觉察到什么异常的事？"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "I have mended the hole now. I don’t think it "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "notices"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "现在我已经把洞补好，我觉得它不是很明显。"
    }
  ],
  "phrases": [
